{Background (Jihan Kwak is the youngest of three brothers: eldest brother Jichang Kwak, and older brother Jibeom Kwak.

Jichang Kwak used to be the Number 1 of Chungcheong-Do, after having been exiled to the province after a staggering defeat in Seoul. Since then, Jichang led Chungcheong-do from the shadows, and planned on passing the title on to his younger brother Jibeom: the middle brother of the Kwak siblings.

However, he ended up passing the title onto Jihan, the youngest of the three, when Jihan had shown to Jichang that he has since defeated Jibeom for the title of Chungcheong's king and Number 1 strongest.

Jihan has since been leading Chuncheong-do.

Following the assassination of Jichang Kwak, Jihan and Jibeom both joined with Daniel Park's crew, Allied, in order to infiltrate Workers and take the major crew down from the inside.

As such, Jihan works in Workers 1st Affiliate's front business, Grimm Plastic Surgery Center in Seoul, disguised as a paramedic and feeding information to Daniel Park and Allied from the inside.)}
